Subject: [OS-12 / HW-08] Port balanced VPU5 PM to the Nabu 7.4 driver

GPL-2.0-only. Adapt iris-vpu5-balanced-pm-production.patch and
iris-release-zero-opp.patch, retaining their attribution and reference in
docs/iris-driver-review.md. Preserve 7.4 disable_arp/session-cap setup and
existing power ownership field; mark ownership only after successful power-on.
Compile and physical validation pending; no new hardware claim.

